  "accepted": [
    "GUI290 before failure: Artists query Fixture narrows to one artist; opening details and Back clears it to three artists with a different first item. Initial Songs Alphabetic menu is unmarked despite actual native title sorting. The before process exits normally with all guards; that does not accept its failed navigation.",
    "PageExt stores its SearchCtx pattern in the current session history entry. PageLoader restores the alias as an initial leaf property before row selection. Both current entry identity and exact route guard outgoing signals; no search string is added to persistent settings.",
    "GUI293 Artists Back restores Fixture and one artist; detail starts fresh, independently retains Missing/zero results on Forward, and Clear stays cleared after Back/Forward. Songs My filter survives native folder drill-down; the new track page has an empty query. Paused primary video stays at0.",
    "Songs sort projection uses the native model fallback when the saved criterion is empty. The menu marks Alphabetic; selecting the current criterion reverses native folder order and saves the explicit key. Cold startup restores ascending My/Nested/N\u00e4ive order and the marked menu with an empty query.",
    "Primary video continues during folder Forward/Back:13s and paused24.998474s are observed on the same media; the parent My query returns. Traditional Back reopens Fixture popup/one artist; editing with a space preserves video0, Escape clears/closes, table Enter only navigates, and returning keeps cleared filter and selected Fixture.",
    "All three final apps exit0/602modules/zero error diagnostics with source, staged/base runtime, fixtures, producer and cache guards true. The shared staging helper uses byte-identical copies only for EMLINK/Windows1142; the real saturated source exercises521 copied files and preserves base runtime hashes."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Component history uses production PageExt/PageLoader/StackViewExt/MainViewLoader with supplied dependencies and real Qt property maps; it does not execute C++ NavigationHistory or the actual classic SearchBox. Ordinary apps provide those scoped flows. Initial component attempts failed on adapter syntax/missing attached property/typed PySide pointer conversion before the final adapter repair.",
    "The first GUI293 stage reached Windows1142 on AUTHORS.txt before launching VLC. That failed output remains separate. A fresh run used the narrow copy fallback, without deleting old runtimes or changing application behavior.",
    "Some immediate UIA trees/screenshots show transitions or stale predecessors; settled captures are acceptance. Warm observation15 precedes the Forward transition; observation16 supplies the actual destination. Classic observation06 precedes popup-close animation; observation07 proves closure. Initial search clicks sometimes only focus Back; typing follows a visible caret. Complete accessibility geometry remains open.",
    "Ctrl+F was tried as a search shortcut but is VLC Open Folder. Its picker was cancelled without selecting a folder; no shortcut change or search-shortcut acceptance is claimed.",
    "Sort arrows/selection were assessed in actual menu captures, not its incomplete UIA tree. Search history is session-only by design. No full category matrix, visual score, Windows DPI, multi-selection Play, rapid in-flight artist changes, physical endpoint, Windows10 or consolidated final-package acceptance."
  ]
